{"id":"2a1bca4da285ab7f","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-pair-reducibility.md","title":"不交集合对的三区域归约","display":"df-pair-reducibility — 不交集合对的三区域归约","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-pair-reducibility","aliases":["20-df-pair-reducibility"],"display":"df-pair-reducibility — 不交集合对的三区域归约","chapter":"2","section":"2.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 2.4.9","source_printed_pages":[40],"source_pdf_pages":[76],"depends_on":["[[20-df-mred]]","[[20-df-one-reduction]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-pair-reducibility"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-pair-reducibility</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pair-reducibility — 不交集合对的三区域归约"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 2.4.9"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>40</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>76</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d5dada982b721c80\" href=\"?note=d5dada982b721c80\" title=\"20-df-mred\">20-df-mred</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1f15de2c66c6318e\" href=\"?note=1f15de2c66c6318e\" title=\"20-df-one-reduction\">20-df-one-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span> 为已定义的全可计算函数族限制；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_0\\cap A_1=B_0\\cap B_1=\\varnothing\">\\(A_0\\cap A_1=B_0\\cap B_1=\\varnothing\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\{m,1\\}\">\\(r\\in\\{m,1\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d5dada982b721c80\" href=\"?note=d5dada982b721c80\" title=\"20-df-mred\">20-df-mred</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1f15de2c66c6318e\" href=\"?note=1f15de2c66c6318e\" title=\"20-df-one-reduction\">20-df-one-reduction</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pair\\text{-}reducibility}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}(B_0,B_1)\\le_m(A_0,A_1)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [f[B_0]\\subseteq A_0\\land f[B_1]\\subseteq A_1\\land f[\\omega\\setminus(B_0\\cup B_1)]\\subseteq\\omega\\setminus(A_0\\cup A_1)],\\\\ (B_0,B_1)\\le_1(A_0,A_1)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [(\\forall x,y\\ [f(x)=f(y)\\Rightarrow x=y])\\land\\forall i&lt;2\\ \\forall x\\ (x\\in B_i\\Longleftrightarrow f(x)\\in A_i)].\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pair\\text{-}reducibility}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}(B_0,B_1)\\le_m(A_0,A_1)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [f[B_0]\\subseteq A_0\\land f[B_1]\\subseteq A_1\\land f[\\omega\\setminus(B_0\\cup B_1)]\\subseteq\\omega\\setminus(A_0\\cup A_1)],\\\\ (B_0,B_1)\\le_1(A_0,A_1)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [(\\forall x,y\\ [f(x)=f(y)\\Rightarrow x=y])\\land\\forall i&lt;2\\ \\forall x\\ (x\\in B_i\\Longleftrightarrow f(x)\\in A_i)].\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第三个区域不能遗漏；若只要求前两种包含，域外点可能被送入任一目标列，无法得到两坐标的双向成员等价。单射条件在断言内完全展开。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 2.4.9；印刷页 40；PDF 第 76 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-mred","status":"resolved","id":"d5dada982b721c80","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-mred]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-one-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"1f15de2c66c6318e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-one-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}$ 为已定义的全可计算函数族限制；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-mred","status":"resolved","id":"d5dada982b721c80","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-mred]]；see [[20-df-one-reduction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-one-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"1f15de2c66c6318e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-mred]]；see [[20-df-one-reduction]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A_0\\cap A_1=B_0\\cap B_1=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\{m,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pair\\text{-}reducibility}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}(B_0,B_1)\\le_m(A_0,A_1)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [f[B_0]\\subseteq A_0\\land f[B_1]\\subseteq A_1\\land f[\\omega\\setminus(B_0\\cup B_1)]\\subseteq\\omega\\setminus(A_0\\cup A_1)],\\\\ (B_0,B_1)\\le_1(A_0,A_1)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [(\\forall x,y\\ [f(x)=f(y)\\Rightarrow x=y])\\land\\forall i<2\\ \\forall x\\ (x\\in B_i\\Longleftrightarrow f(x)\\in A_i)].\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1683,"backlinks":[{"id":"d206adde37fe6db8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pair-reducibility]]；see [[20-ex-diagonal-effective-inseparable]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-pair-reducibility]] — 章 2；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-pair-reducibility]]"}],"outgoing":["d5dada982b721c80","1f15de2c66c6318e","e343870c773cb68e"]}